    name="eFin Current State"
    id="id-b652e25b05374f15994fe559fb06ae7b"
    documentation="Homes England's core financial ledger and reporting system, version 5.5, hosted in Hampshire and managed by HE. Acts as the backbone of HE's ledger operations — if it goes down, all dependent ledger processes are affected. Runs on end-of-life technology (Oracle 8, Java, Oracle WebLogic 3) with no OpenID, REST, or modern token-based authentication support. Has no native reporting capability; SAP BI provides reporting via direct database access.">
